{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a3e827595127868660408e9fef8e238c8d38d16a0a9ad09d38092c0e4e56f329", "ja": "（静香と、次の仕事の打ち合わせが終わったが……\nスケジュール調整ミスで、ダメ出しされてしまった）", "zh": "（和静香一起开完下次工作的会议了……\n但由于行程安排出错，因此在会议上受到指正。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "9992b57fa369bfa16d637d3a3a22af401ea54477d028bebe8f3476a2fecc32ff", "ja": "お疲れさまでした。\n{$P$}、ちゃんとしてくださいね？", "zh": "辛苦了。\n{$P$}，你工作可得更认真点喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c1ef506381fd68f693276d45b120c20793a582f99da7e37800ef9e875465d495", "ja": "すまない……\n静香に迷惑がかからないよう、できる限り努力するよ。", "zh": "抱歉……\n静香，我会尽最大努力，不会造成你困扰的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "b68ddfa520c9d0b8476218d3781e3a65fdc181f796650b5bc4cb0a994393b533", "ja": "私の迷惑とかじゃなくて……はぁ。\nもういいです。それじゃ、失礼しま……え？", "zh": "重点不是我困不困扰……唉。\n算了。那么，我先告辞……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "d8f010d48f152c077bcb1cbbd3e76a2b0d7bdcd9a66589303389330c3aa678d1", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\nそのパンダのパペットって、この前のお仕事の……？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n那只熊猫手偶，难道是上次工作的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e9935d198f970e1604f8d330d3c81527767bafbd49129c0c9378bd9e1d0eb5d6", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。\n静香も気に入って買ってただろ？　可愛いよな。", "zh": "喔，对啊。静香你不也因为很喜欢\n所以买了一个？真的很可爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "a9f3d7c5d4662798a15eb7794cf6f1a5969c1a911b42cb540c3b39af43ee1efc", "ja": "かわいいって……{$P$}、\nこういうの好きなんですか？　大人なのに？", "zh": "可爱……{$P$}，\n你喜欢这种东西吗？明明都是个大人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ba93d671951a753553844832bc0ec2cd040669c0f501e6a3b2fc6ccc3fd6a74a", "ja": "ははは。大人だって、たまには\n可愛いものに癒されたいことがあるんだよ。", "zh": "哈哈哈。\n大人偶尔也会想被可爱的东西疗愈一下啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "65d6586e9ca66c031468887bf8d189a642a4bd8e6a5d8c9a1e8448ae15d20697", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか？\nふーん……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？\n是喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "ce0da507eb50150a2b038eddcb0d36632603062be32b98aefde10c47396ec61c", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\nそれ……ちょっと貸してください。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n手偶……请借我一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9f9b57a1319a8757899b18765aa3e48386e5e7d828d1c51fa5559b4909585c3d", "ja": "いいけど、どうするんだ？", "zh": "好是好，但你要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "80bfe7ace9ecabd67ee59fb0594d2ea4cd175b57529e504011187f45c06bb375", "ja": "いいから、こっち見ないでくださいね。\n……コホン。", "zh": "你先别管，不可以看这边喔。\n……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "0d7c52f7ff69dee51f3db81bf881010042f2d0897bf1084568100ad6c95d0980", "ja": "「コンニチハ！　ぼく、パンダのパン太！\n{$P$}、はじめましてパンダー！」", "zh": "「你好！我是熊猫，叫做熊猫太！\n{$P$}，初次见面熊猫～！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1014_p", "source_sha256": "14b84fb1b711d3123b375e6fe4698467a0d766fd8023038534bc661085ac66fd", "ja": "し、静香？", "zh": "静、静香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "5591bda35352bbcfa18e216051c5a34ccf059071b9dcd3ccdd78302e4062fdf8", "ja": "「し、静香じゃないパンダ！　パン太だパンダ！\n間違えないでくだ、間違えたらダメパンダ！」", "zh": "「我、我不是静香熊猫！我是熊猫太熊猫！\n请你不要……你可别弄错了熊猫！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "236a97d4695acee2b6e79bf78dc90e75253c986ebaaaba10d5a71a7ad8b7b284", "ja": "あ、はい。\nそれでパン太さんは、どうしてここに？", "zh": "啊，好。\n那么熊猫太，你来这里做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "d77d60cf67d827654f7747c6735fe76d01cb035468dbcbebbdc0d46654614b8c", "ja": "「静香の代わりに、{$P$}にひとこと\n言いに来たパンダ！　静香は別に、怒ってないパンダ」", "zh": "「我是代替静香来向{$P$}\n传话的熊猫！其实静香并没有生气熊猫。」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "72f111750fccf8db0e064b4ef790561ad303a84933b8450793bc340d6cffc501", "ja": "「単純ミスで仕事をふいにするのは、もったいない\nパンダ！　だから、ちゃんと仕事してほしいパンダ！」", "zh": "「因为简单的疏失就让工作泡汤太可惜了熊猫！\n所以，她希望你工作能认真点熊猫！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1019_p", "source_sha256": "74bc3382d632fc1f821cdc65992906c332f18baf2720d5866f294455e85647af", "ja": "静香……。", "zh": "静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "efc3b24f92d9a954cb673933f1137ebf4b23d157884f8092a43fb5beab81aca9", "ja": "え、えっと……じゃあ、失礼します。\n本当に、ちゃんとしてくださいね！", "zh": "那、那……那么，我先告辞了。\n请你真的要好好工作喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0093_1021_p", "source_sha256": "70b21c0f01fb4852eaa2032fed2303a5e09042dab1d6fdb5287f80633fbd129b", "ja": "（……パン太にも期待されてるみたいだし、落ち込んで\nいられないな。よし、もうひと頑張りしていこう！）", "zh": "（……熊猫太似乎也很期待我的表现，\n我可不能继续沮丧下去了。好，再努力一下吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
